title Stage-Level Cache Decisions (Enrichment, Taxonomy, Merge)

participant Notebook
participant Pipeline
participant EnrichmentCache as _cache/enrichment_stage_stamp.json
participant TaxonomyCache as _cache/taxonomy_stage_stamp.json
participant MergeCache as _cache/merge_stage_stamp.json
participant Results

Notebook->Pipeline: run_enrichment_stage(...)
Pipeline->EnrichmentCache: Compare current stamp vs previous stamp
EnrichmentCache->Pipeline: cache hit or miss
Pipeline->Results: Hit: load enriched artifacts
Pipeline->Results: Miss: rebuild and write enriched artifacts

Notebook->Pipeline: run_taxonomy_stage(...)
Pipeline->TaxonomyCache: Compare taxonomy stamp
TaxonomyCache->Pipeline: cache hit or miss
Pipeline->Results: Hit: load abundance matrix + taxon lookup
Pipeline->Results: Miss: rebuild and write taxonomy artifacts

Notebook->Pipeline: run_merge_stage(...)
Pipeline->MergeCache: Compare merge stamp
MergeCache->Pipeline: cache hit or miss
Pipeline->Results: Hit: load analysis-wide dataset
Pipeline->Results: Miss: rebuild merged dataset
Pipeline->Results: Update compatibility stamp Ask_SLM_Cache_Stamp.json